<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>AI &amp; Agent 开发者晨报</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>每日 AI 领域精选新闻与深度分析</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 10:45:50 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/web/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><item><title>百度开源文心5.5 Flash Base：280B MoE基座，激活参数14B</title><link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/05/baidu-ernie-5-5-flash-base-280b-moe/</link><description>百度开源文心5.5 Flash Base预训练基座，总参数280B、MoE架构下激活仅14B，官方称在多基准测试刷新同尺寸模型SOTA，并同步放出原始checkpoint供二次训练。</description><guid>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/05/baidu-ernie-5-5-flash-base-280b-moe/</guid><source>MarkTechPost</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 05:33:00 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>MoE</category><category>开源权重</category></item><item><title>OpenAI推出GPT-6 Cyber：既能攻破系统也能给出修复方案</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/openais-gpt-6-cyber-can-both-break-into-systems-and-propose-how-to-fix-them/</link><description>OpenAI发布面向安全场景的GPT-6 Cyber，可自动发现系统漏洞并同时提出修复建议，定位为攻防一体的安全模型，具体基准分数与开放范围原文未披露。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/openais-gpt-6-cyber-can-both-break-into-systems-and-propose-how-to-fix-them/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 04:36:25 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>安全</category><category>漏洞挖掘</category></item><item><title>Together AI发布Together Compiler：Agent驱动推理最高提速2.6倍</title><link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/05/together-ai-together-compiler-continual-compilation-ai-inference/</link><description>Together AI推出Together Compiler（TKCC），一套由Agent驱动的持续编译系统，官方称可将推理速度最高提升2.6倍，思路是让Agent根据运行时反馈自动生成并迭代优化算子。</description><guid>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/05/together-ai-together-compiler-continual-compilation-ai-inference/</guid><source>MarkTechPost</source><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:02:58 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>推理加速</category><category>Agent</category></item><item><title>Perplexity推出面向工作的AI Agent产品</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1028302/perplexity-teammates-ai-agents-work</link><description>Perplexity发布面向职场场景的AI Agent，直接对标OpenAI与Anthropic的同类产品，主打替用户完成跨应用的多步工作任务，具体定价与可用范围原文未披露。</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1028302/perplexity-teammates-ai-agents-work</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 06:26:50 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>产品与发布</category></item><item><title>Amazon Bedrock AgentCore的Web Answer功能正式可用</title><link>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/getting-started-with-web-answer-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/</link><description>AWS宣布Amazon Bedrock AgentCore上的Web Answer功能正式GA，让Agent在推理过程中直接检索并引用网页内容作答，配套文档给出接入步骤与配置方式。</description><guid>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/getting-started-with-web-answer-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/</guid><source>AWS ML Blog</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 05:04:24 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>RAG</category><category>AWS</category></item><item><title>腾讯发布开源模型Hy4，跻身全球领先开源模型行列</title><link>https://www.tencent.com/tencent-launches-hy4-joining-the-ranks-of-the-worlds-leading-open-source-ai-models/</link><description>腾讯正式发布开源模型Hy4，官方称其加入全球领先开源模型行列，但新闻稿未披露参数规模、架构细节与基准测试成绩，具体能力需待权重与评测放出后验证。</description><guid>https://www.tencent.com/tencent-launches-hy4-joining-the-ranks-of-the-worlds-leading-open-source-ai-models/</guid><source>HackerNews AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 04:21:43 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>开源权重</category></item><item><title>MoE训练手册发布：用Megatron-LM逐项配置训练混合专家模型</title><link>https://www.reddit.com/r/MachineLearning/comments/1xorgq0/the_ultimate_moe_training_handbook_training/</link><description>社区发布《Ultimate MoE Training Handbook》，以Megatron-LM为底座逐项讲解MoE模型的训练配置，涵盖并行策略、专家路由与负载均衡等设置，并托管在HuggingFace Space上。</description><guid>https://www.reddit.com/r/MachineLearning/comments/1xorgq0/the_ultimate_moe_training_handbook_training/</guid><source>Reddit ML</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:13:51 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>MoE</category><category>Megatron-LM</category></item><item><title>论文提出Agent Harness Awareness：把验证过的遥测转为工具型Agent的运行控制</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05391</link><description>arXiv新论文提出Agent Harness Awareness方法，将经过验证的运行时遥测信号转化为工具调用型Agent的操作控制依据，用以弥补工具描述本身无法反映真实执行状态的缺陷。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05391</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>Agent</category><category>可观测性</category></item><item><title>论文提出从像素到动作的原生视觉-语言-动作策略</title><link>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2118400919637508576</link><description>研究者发布论文《From Pixels to Actions》，提出原生视觉-语言-动作（VLA）策略，让模型直接从像素输入映射到机器人动作输出，论文与权重已在HuggingFace公开。</description><guid>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2118400919637508576</guid><source>Twitter @_akhaliq</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 01:51:51 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>VLA</category><category>机器人</category></item><item><title>VAR-Q：面向视觉自回归图像与视频生成的无调优KV Cache量化</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05380</link><description>arXiv论文提出VAR-Q，针对视觉自回归图像与视频生成场景做免调优的KV Cache量化，在不重新训练模型的前提下压缩缓存占用，以缓解长序列生成时的显存压力。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05380</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>KV Cache</category><category>量化</category></item><item><title>论文探讨多Agent评审制度中谁有权否决Agent</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05390</link><description>arXiv论文研究多Agent语言模型系统中的权限治理问题，提出“证据门控授权”机制，规定在何种证据条件下某个Agent才有权推翻其他Agent的结论，以约束评审流程中的越权行为。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05390</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>多Agent</category><category>治理</category></item><item><title>Meta向美国用户开放Muse AI虚拟形象视频通话</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/meta-says-us-users-can-now-video-chat-with-their-muse-ai-avatar/</link><description>Meta宣布美国用户可与Muse AI虚拟形象进行视频通话，该Agent以可定制的动画形象接听来电，基于此前Connect上预览的Muse Realtime Avatar实时具身技术。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/meta-says-us-users-can-now-video-chat-with-their-muse-ai-avatar/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:48:28 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>数字人</category><category>实时交互</category></item><item><title>进展：量子位：MIT神作被质疑，Astra被指只是爆改Qwen权重</title><link>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/11/507782.html</link><description>量子位报道，spaCy作者发长文质疑此前被热捧的MIT成果Astra，认为其所谓突破实为对Qwen权重的改造，而非原创方法，引发社区对论文宣传与实际贡献的讨论。</description><guid>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/11/507782.html</guid><source>量子位</source><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 15:10:56 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>开源权重</category><category>学术争议</category></item><item><title>Airbnb称将于2027年上半年推出AI旅行Agent</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/airbnb-says-its-launching-an-ai-travel-agent-in-the-first-half-of-2027/</link><description>Airbnb宣布将在2027年上半年上线AI旅行Agent，帮助用户规划行程、比较住宿选项并完成预订，具体模型选型与技术架构未披露。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/airbnb-says-its-launching-an-ai-travel-agent-in-the-first-half-of-2027/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 06:40:55 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>Agent</category><category>旅行</category></item><item><title>进展：MIT Tech Review：得州AI繁荣脆弱，能源政策转向带来变数</title><link>https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/11/05/1144908/the-download-texas-fragile-ai-boom-us-energy-policy/</link><description>MIT Tech Review的The Download指出，得克萨斯州此前的AI数据中心建设热潮正面临能源政策转向的压力，电力供给与审批节奏成为制约当地AI算力扩张的关键变量。</description><guid>https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/11/05/1144908/the-download-texas-fragile-ai-boom-us-energy-policy/</guid><source>MIT Tech Review</source><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 21:10:00 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>数据中心</category><category>能源</category></item><item><title>GitHub详解全新Git存储架构</title><link>https://github.blog/engineering/architecture-optimization/inside-githubs-new-git-storage-architecture/</link><description>GitHub在Universe上公布新的Git存储架构后，工程博客进一步说明其设计：通过重构底层存储层提升仓库读写性能与扩展性，以支撑持续增长的代码托管规模。</description><guid>https://github.blog/engineering/architecture-optimization/inside-githubs-new-git-storage-architecture/</guid><source>GitHub Blog</source><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 04:23:21 +0800</pubDate><category>GitHub</category><category>基础设施</category></item><item><title>今日深度分析 - 2026-11-06</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>今日主线是开源与Agent基建：百度280B MoE基座、腾讯Hy4接连开源，稀疏架构成主流；Together Compiler用Agent做编译优化、Perplexity与AWS补齐Agent产品与检索能力，Agent正从演示走向可运维的工程系统。</description><guid>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/daily-analysis/20261106</guid></item></channel></rss>